{"v":4,"catch":"釣魚衝刺 – 投入最終極的釣魚冒險！","desc":"甩出魚線，享受無限樂趣！在 Fishing Rush 中，你將體驗一款充滿活力、適合所有年齡層的釣魚遊戲。穿梭於色彩繽紛的水域，解鎖新裝備，並在快節奏、易上手的街機體驗中捕捉各種魚類。\n無論你是資深漁夫，還是單純為了娛樂而釣魚，水面下總有驚喜等待著你。享受流暢的玩法、迷人的視覺效果，以及令人上癮的挑戰，讓你一次又一次回來遊玩。\n\n遊戲特色：\n輕鬆且充滿回報感的釣魚玩法\n繽紛多彩的環境\n容易上手，樂趣無窮","publisher":"Gametry","release":"2025-09-04","genres":["街機","模擬"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/ea8d55136bdbb0ef6911e02d5e753ad43add750c2a7d415c6f9fdbc460929f08.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/2cc8c35d5fa5a71d042c9223a2b7590604ac362fbc929f036bb5c19acf3d46fd.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/298526ebd28dffd86cdab2e97fba10f8f3277b3e81e167c77b04448e61f2d154.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/e2d48cc5e8ab39b0e4e2c3619f1a59aa0fbab8d44b6beb079f4aca6bdb3f08f1.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/7bef5a2520bbfabe174a5b522c47d00ea3e22c706f225714c347c6c1fa381bf2.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/c6d64d15c138f2c78a2493b893a10b9333155450fa2ca4beb08774cc06ebedd4.jpg"],"titleId":"0100c51024ee6000","dlc":[]}